# Keen32 -warp 6 -script (Prova-Dispositivi.ps1 -Control -1 -Level 6): a small level to its end. Keen walks left, then right, and walks off the
# edge of the map: playstate is levelcomplete, the level is marked as done and the game goes back to the world map.
wait 200
shot t0.png
down left
wait 120
shot t1.png
up left
down right
wait 200
shot t2.png
wait 200
shot t3.png
quit
